# The parent repository's .gitignore does NOT reach here: a pattern with a
# separator in the middle, like `.clj-kondo/*`, is anchored to the directory of
# the .gitignore that declares it. So this project keeps its own, and it must,
# whether or not it stays inside that repository.
.cpcache/
.nrepl-port
.rebel_readline_history

# The linter's cache is derived; its configuration is not — that is a decision
# this project made, so it travels.
.clj-kondo/.cache/
.clj-kondo/imports/

# LSP
.lsp/

# datahike. A store is the fact itself rather than a rendering of one, and a
# directory of growing binary files is no use in a repository.
*.mdb
